 are you talking about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_53","text":"The handprints and liquid stains! It was you!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_54","text":"Oh... that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_55","text":"And what if I did?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_56","text":"This is a sacred statue, and you're defiling it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_57","text":"How can you stand there and act like nothing is wrong, after committing such a heinous act?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_58","text":"Calm down already, don't have a conniption.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_59","text":"You're acting like I poured this stuff over your own head.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_60","text":"This statue was built in memory of all those fallen Nikkes!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_61","text":"I wouldn't be so sure of that if I were you. I say the humans who constructed this statue also constructed that story.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_62","text":"All that nonsense about commemorating fallen Nikkes was just to make it seem special and get more Nikkes to come see this hunk of rock.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_63","text":"Even if that were the case,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_64","text":"defacing statues isn't right!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_65","text":"You act as if I'm doing this for no reason.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_66","text":"Did you not hear what I just said?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_67","text":"I'm hoping this will lead me to the Pilgrim!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_68","text":"Then what was that squeaking sound just now? Whatever you're using is eating away at the statue!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_69","text":"And?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_70","text":"If that isn't careless, then what is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_71","text":"This is absurd! You're a Nikke yourself, how could you...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_72","text":"You're the one being ridiculous! Why can't you understand that searching for clues regarding that Pilgrim","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_73","text":"is more important than honoring a few dead Nikkes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_74","text":"I can see that you're from Seraphim, so you must be a doctor, yes? How can you be so harebrained?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_75","text":"Has your entire mind been taken over by sentimentality?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_76","text":"This is about morality, not sentimentality.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_77","text":"Argh! You're so irritating!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_78","text":"Fine, I'll stop. Happy now?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_79","text":"For all I know, this may be a Seraphim conspiracy. What do I care?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_80","text":"I quit, so save your breath.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_81","text":"Typical doctor, always prattling on...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_82","text":"Hey!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_83","text":"See you around, No.7.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_84","text":"Don't forget to tell me if you see anyone from Seraphim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_85","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_85","text":"Ether leaves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_86","text":"Some people just can't be reasoned with!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_leisuretime","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_87","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_87","text":"Calm down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_88","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_89","text":"Just look at this mess she made! She left without even cleaning it up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_90","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_90","text":"... Let's roll up our sleeves and get to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"pepper","key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_91","text":"The next time I see her, I'm gonna give her a piece of my mind!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_92","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenStory:d_ex_goddessofvictory_03_92","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}